<p>New shops get <strong>30 days free</strong> on the Business plan. The owner sees the plan, what's in use and every invoice under <strong>Settings → Billing</strong>.</p>

<h2>Paying</h2>
<p>When the trial ends HardPoint emails the first invoice, due a week later. Pay it from the Billing page with an M-Pesa prompt to your phone, or by card. A reminder comes two days before it's due, and a receipt when it's paid. You can also start paying before the trial ends.</p>

<h2>Changing plan</h2>
<p>Pick another plan on the Billing page. A bigger plan applies straight away. A smaller one only if your branches, tills, staff and products fit within it. The new price applies from the next invoice.</p>

<h2>If an invoice isn't paid</h2>
<p>A week after it's due, the shop becomes <strong>read-only</strong>: everyone can still sign in and look things up, and the owner can export the data, but nothing can be sold or changed. Paying the invoice unlocks the shop straight away. Offline sales rung up before the lock are still accepted.</p>
